              "text": "blanditia, blanditiae — \"flattery, coaxing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Blanditiīs fīliae pater nōn resistit. The father does not resist his daughter's coaxing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, first declension; often plural blanditiae — coaxing words."
            }
          ]
        },
